@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title Weapon hit reporting and damage delivery
participant "Unity weapon / collision" as W
participant "ClientHandler" as H
participant "UserManager" as U
participant "Unity GameSystem" as G
W -> H : HIT|weaponIndex|attackerNick|targetNick
note over W,H : Client reports weapon and target
H -> H : Check team membership in cooperative mode
H -> U : GetAttackByIndex(weaponIndex)
U --> H : damage
H -> G : DAMAGE|targetNick|damage
G -> G : Apply received damage / update HUD
note over W,G
Collision and target originate on the client.
Server selects weapon damage; it does not re-simulate the hit.
end note
@enduml
